pada programs vendored for integration testing
================================================

the `.in` files in this directory are pada programs sourced verbatim
from the `examples/` directory of the upstream pada repository:

  https://github.com/m-ender/pada
  copy is at internal/integrationtest/testdata/gems/pada/

each `.in` is the corresponding `<name>.pd` from `examples/`, renamed
so the goruby esolang test harness (which globs `*.in`) picks them up.
the sibling `.expected` files were generated by running

  ruby internal/integrationtest/testdata/gems/pada/pada.rb \
       <fixture>.in </dev/null > <fixture>.expected

under MRI 2.6.10.

`examples/test.pd` is omitted -- it expects stdin and pada itself
crashes under empty stdin on MRI (NoMethodError on nil), so there's
no useful baseline.

